From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hayaksi1 <193020925+hayaksi1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 22:10:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Collect the relocated fork tests and restore the dropped cases

The vitest move left fork tests under apps/web/src with a -test suffix,
which no runner collects, and several merges kept none of the branch's
tests. This patch renames those suites, fixes the imports and DOM
environment they need, puts the dropped cases back, opens threads
full-size on this build, passes the room view store into jump-to-date,
and refreshes the snapshots the rebuilt styles and the search button moved.

0004 is folded in here: the jest-to-vitest conversion of SearchWarning
no longer needs its own patch. The jest config patch is obsolete.

---
